### 1) Login as admin (auth-service :8081)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@scalecart.com",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("accessToken", response.body.accessToken);
%}

### 2) Create product (product-service :8082) — needs ADMIN role
POST http://localhost:8082/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Wireless Mouse",
  "description": "Ergonomic wireless mouse",
  "price": 1299.99,
  "stockQuantity": 75,
  "categoryId": 1
}

### 3) Public — list products (no token needed)
GET http://localhost:8082/api/products?page=0&size=10
